OL,3,AFrance accuses Iran of supermarket
OL,4,Afridge hacking
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrance has accused Iran's Islamic
OL,7,FRevolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) of
OL,8,Fbeing behind cyber-attacks that raised
OL,9,Fthe temperatures of supermarket fridges
OL,10,Fand freezers across the country last
OL,11,Fmonth.
OL,13,FFrench Foreign Minister Jean-Noel
OL,14,FBarrot said the attack was
OL,15,F"unprecedented in both its scale and
OL,16,Fits level of aggression", adding those
OL,17,Fwho were responsible would be hit with
OL,18,Fsanctions "at the European level".
OL,20,FIran is yet to respond to Barrot's
OL,21,Fallegations.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
