OL,3,AFrance accuses Iran of supermarket
OL,4,Afridge hacking
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cyber-attack last month saw fridges
OL,7,Fand freezers in hundreds of
OL,8,Fsupermarkets across France heated up,
OL,9,Fwhich spoilt fresh and frozen food
OL,10,Festimated to be worth millions of
OL,11,Feuros.
